# A follower that only ever slices: once another driver ends the remediation it waits forever.
MODULE: OperationTerminatesFollowerNeverReturns
TARGET: OperationTerminates
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: a driver whose remediation another driver ended never learns of it
PERTURBS: Observe

--- FIND
    /\ opWork[o] = "Driving" /\ alive[opRunner[o]]
    /\ (~remInProgress \/ remOwner # opFollows[o])
--- REPLACE
    /\ opWork[o] = "Driving" /\ alive[opRunner[o]] /\ FALSE
    /\ (~remInProgress \/ remOwner # opFollows[o])
--- END
